    912  f632							; here) -> bank0's `jmp LF_B0Tail`, which runs EnterRoom + the level-start
    913  f632							; placement + `jmp DropArm` in bank0. 0 extra jsr levels, 0 pushes: the stack
    914  f632							; depth of boot/RESET/title/tally (sim_bomb_fuse, test_tally) is unchanged.
